#: patterns/front-page.php:38
msgid "Hariko: A Minimalist WordPress Block Theme for Customization"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/front-page.php:42
msgid "is a WordPress block editor theme designed with a minimalist aesthetic and built for customization."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/front-page.php:46
msgid "It includes ten font-size presets from xs (12px) to xxxxxxl (57px), with a default medium size of 16px, making it an ideal starter theme."
msgstr ""

